# pyridine.msf
# Pyridine / pyridinium
# pKa=5.230 (pyridinium → pyridine)
# Source: Perrin 1981 / NIST
# Pure aromatic N-base without fused ring or substituents.
# Nicotinic acid (training) has pyridinium pKa=2.05 but always with
# COOH group. Pure pyridine isolates the aromatic N-base contribution.

